<title>NETHERLANDS: AMSTERDAM RUBBER H1 NET SLUMPS, SEES BETTER.</title>
<headline>AMSTERDAM RUBBER H1 NET SLUMPS, SEES BETTER.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.46 vs   1.74</p>
<p>    Turnover			     216.7  vs 202.4</p>
<p>Note - Spices and rubber trader NV Rubber Cultuur</p>
<p>Maatschappij said it expected the second half of 1996 would be</p>
<p>'much better' than the first and that the full year would be</p>
<p>another profitable one for the group.</p>
</text>
